source:
Tom and Katie are discussing whether simultaneous equations are in an appropriate form to be added or subtracted, or whether they need transforming first. Tom says these equations are in an appropriate form
\(
\begin{array}{l}
2 x-3 y=10 \\
5 x+3 y=18
\end{array}
\) Katie says these equations are in an appropriate form
\(
\begin{array}{l}
2 x-3 y=10 \\
2 x+y=4
\end{array}
\) Who is correct?

translation:
Tom na Katie wanajadili ikiwa milinganyo ya wakati mmoja iko katika umbo linalofaa ili kuongezwa au kupunguzwa, au ikiwa inahitaji kubadilishwa kwanza. Tom anasema milinganyo hii iko katika umbo linalofaa.
\(
\begin{array}{l}
2 x-3 y=10 \\
5 x+3 y=18
\end{array}
\) Katie anasema milinganyo hii iko katika umbo linalofaa.
\(
\begin{array}{l}
2 x-3 y=10 \\
2 x+y=4
\end{array}
\) Ni nani anayesema ukweli?

